# G0215D gpio-keys. Stock DTS wired PM8994 GPIO 5 as the front Home
# switch (linux,code 102) and GPIO 4 as the extra Gree key (59).
# The current kernel still inherits MTP codes (528 FOCUS, 766 CAMERA),
# so both the stock and MTP scan codes map to the same Android keys.
# Do not use a custom label such as GREE_KEY: KeyLayoutMap rejects the
# whole file and EventHub falls back to Generic.kl (102 = MOVE_HOME).

key 115   VOLUME_UP
key 114   VOLUME_DOWN
key 102   HOME
key 528   HOME
key 59    F1
key 766   F1
